ary of Our Lady of Fatima Shrine, a place of worldwide"},{"kind":"text","t":24699.608532,"text":"また北へ向かい、世界的な聖地であるファティマの聖母大聖堂を訪れてください。"},{"kind":"audio","t":24757.623374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24762.228439,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24767.522694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24772.704610999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":24777.830889,"samples":28528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":31550.209720999996,"text":"According to Japan's nuclear agency, radioactive casein and iodine has been identified at the plant."},{"kind":"text","t":31925.735307,"text":"日本の原子力規制庁によると、発電所で放射性セシウムとヨウ素が検出されました。"},{"kind":"audio","t":31983.734008999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31988.850037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31994.109892999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31999.419888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32005.638479999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"audio","t":32005.896737,"samples":6560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":40590.569269,"text":"The document, according to the leak, will refer to the borders dispute, which Palestine wants based on the borders before the 1967 Mideast War."},{"kind":"text","t":41280.447583,"text":"漏洩した情報によると、その文書では国境紛争について言及される予定であり、パレスチナ側は1967年の中東戦争前の国境に基づくことを望んでいます。"},{"kind":"audio","t":41362.889401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41368.171686,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41373.869826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41379.347749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41384.493556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41390.815457000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41396.057423000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41399.391586000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41402.981106,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41406.040132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41409.243887000004,"samples":31720,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":46948.931518000005,"text":"The capital of Moldova is Chisinau. The local language is Romanian but Russian."},{"kind":"text","t":47219.516193,"text":"モルドバの首都はキシナウです。現地語はルーマニア語ですが、ロシア語です。"},{"kind":"audio","t":47260.692713000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":47262.385729,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47263.911498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47265.467116,"samples":32496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":56063.896784000004,"text":"The other nominations include Best Picture, Director of Cinematography, Costume Design, Film Editing, Original Score,"},{"kind":"text","t":56487.585211000005,"text":"その他のノミネートには、作品賞、撮影賞、衣装デザイン賞、編集賞、作曲賞が含まれています。"},{"kind":"audio","t":56547.284249000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56552.842951000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56557.87266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56563.171745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56568.5238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56573.618598,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":61320.055532000006,"text":"production design, sound editing, sound mixing, and original screenplay."},{"kind":"text","t":61659.434548000005,"text":"美術賞、音響編集賞、音響効果編集賞、そして脚本賞です。"},{"kind":"audio","t":61713.981649,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61719.253454000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61724.623099000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61730.374008000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":61732.067754,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":67548.253596,"text":"Prior to the arrival of troops, Haiti had not encountered problems related to the disease since the 18th century."},{"kind":"text","t":67997.981676,"text":"軍隊が到着する前、ハイチでは18世紀以来、その病気に関連する問題は発生していませんでした。"},{"kind":"audio","t":68079.323079,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":68084.416587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":68090.134357,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68095.321854,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68100.53478999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68106.10451199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":68107.992435,"samples":13392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75351.034902,"text":"With two years of the end of the war, the former allies were now enemies and the Cold War began."},{"kind":"text","t":75787.881793,"text":"終戦まであと2年というところで、かつての同盟国は今や敵となり、冷戦が始まった。"},{"kind":"audio","t":75847.336935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75852.43655299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75857.376513,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75863.05841299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75868.97314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":75870.112704,"samples":10160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":85367.923692,"text":"In fact, it is not easy to find at all even if one knew it existed once inside the cave it is a total isolation"},{"kind":"text","t":85807.72594199999,"text":"実際、かつて洞窟の中に存在していたとしても、そこは完全に隔離されているため、見つけることは全く容易ではない。"},{"kind":"audio","t":85871.15613799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85876.11336799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85881.790748,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":85887.34568,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85892.72117399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85897.94361,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85903.17674699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"audio","t":85903.55046099999,"samples":5224,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":98291.01663099999,"text":"Unfortunately, stunning traffic flow is difficult because driver behavior cannot be predicted with 100% certainty."},{"kind":"text","t":98759.636915,"text":"残念ながら、ドライバーの行動を100%確実に予測することはできないため、見事な交通流を実現することは困難です。"},{"kind":"audio","t":98811.40611499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98816.541742,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":98822.05127499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98827.91581199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98833.364835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":98838.72632999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98843.496592,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":98843.81680799999,"samples":5824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":108598.563364,"text":"In 2002, Goma was destroyed by lava from the Nyirangogo volcano, which buried most of the town's streets, particularly the town of Goma."},{"kind":"text","t":109203.137701,"text":"2002年、ゴマはニラゴンゴ火山の溶岩によって破壊され、町の通り、特にゴマの町の大部分が埋没しました。"},{"kind":"audio","t":109263.162115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109268.609828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109273.830884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":109279.288827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109284.494324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109289.74455999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":109293.593156,"samples":27192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":114622.15061299999,"text":"Rolando Mendoza fired his M16 rifle at the terrorist."},{"kind":"text","t":114996.16842,"text":"ロランド・メンドーサはテロリストに向けてM16ライフルを発射した。"},{"kind":"audio","t":115054.399089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115059.692315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115065.15908699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115070.60212099999,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":123399.44081999999,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":123769.74702899999,"text":"田舎道での運転に慣れていない場合は、十分に注意してください。急勾配、狭い路地、そして急カーブがいたるところにあります。"},{"kind":"audio","t":123833.47952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123838.74309599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123844.41344599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123849.772931,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123854.642102,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123860.026976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":123865.529249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":123866.436686,"samples":13624,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":132528.026064,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":132996.60969800001,"text":"現代の研究用望遠鏡のほとんどは、気象条件に恵まれた辺境の地にある巨大な施設です。"},{"kind":"audio","t":133065.96858000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133071.249195,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133076.759678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133081.935975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133087.380918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133091.992593,"samples":27560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":138533.93489200002,"text":"The cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic, basic, alkaline the chemical is."},{"kind":"text","t":139051.70267300002,"text":"キャベツの汁は、化学物質がどの程度酸性か、あるいは塩基性・アルカリ性かによって色が変わります。"},{"kind":"audio","t":139123.404042,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":139128.72754700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":139133.920014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139139.17289000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139144.524914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":139149.79789000002,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":145365.33679200002,"text":"This offers a good opportunity to see the Aurora Borealis as the sky will be dark more or less around the time."},{"kind":"text","t":145721.66135900002,"text":"その時間帯は空が暗くなるため、オーロラを見る絶好の機会となります。"},{"kind":"audio","t":145766.232701,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145767.620721,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":145769.205779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":145770.901495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145771.706433,"samples":17128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":151616.46156300002,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":151910.635056,"text":"したがって、その表記は単にラベルとして付け加えられた可能性が高いです。"},{"kind":"audio","t":151963.46144100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151968.553389,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151973.653618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151979.427376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":151980.420962,"samples":10528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":158534.093238,"text":"Parisians have a reputation for being egocentric, rude, and arrogant."},{"kind":"text","t":158843.20101000002,"text":"パリジャンは、自己中心的で失礼で傲慢だという評判があります。"},{"kind":"audio","t":158907.964117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158913.287472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":158918.581187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158924.199548,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"audio","t":158924.540943,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":164529.69880100002,"text":"A curry is a dish based on herbs and spices together with either meat or vegetables."},{"kind":"text","t":164851.994757,"text":"カレーは、肉または野菜にハーブとスパイスを合わせて作る料理です。"},{"kind":"audio","t":164907.301317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164912.82642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164918.245563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164923.950323,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"audio","t":164924.10922,"samples":928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":175703.812467,"code":1005}]}